    "intro": "Holy Cross Anglican Church serves Mount Salem, one of the larger inner-community areas of Montego Bay, situated on the hillside rising above the city’s western districts. Mount Salem is a well-established residential community with a mixed social character, home to working families, small businesses, and a dense network of community institutions. Holy Cross has been the Anglican presence in Mount Salem for several decades, providing worship, pastoral care, and a community anchor in a neighbourhood that has faced both economic pressures and serious security challenges in recent years.",
